      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Thank you for your request!\n\nThis board is about the VRChat Creator Companion. Please resubmit your feedback to our 'Feedback' board.\n\nI really like your suggestion - it would be great if we could customize which eye is displayed in VRChat's desktop view.",
